        "thought_text": "The issue lies in the logic of updating the `dp` array. Specifically, the inner loop should consider all possible pairs `(i, j)` where `i > j`, not just `j < i`. This ensures that we account for all valid transitions between tasks. Additionally, the final result should be the sum of the costs to complete each task in an optimal sequence, not just the minimum value in the `dp` array.",
